Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.06,0:00:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time the rain no longer falls, and I\Nsee the sky, I think the rain is falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.98,0:00:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Back to when I was a child,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.54,0:00:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,who could only cry,\Nblindly chasing after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.00,0:00:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I fell far behind my only thought,\None day I will be stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.06,0:00:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Bridery and gratitude\Nfading with the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.88,0:00:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I stronger now than I was\Nbefore, or as weak as back then?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.38,0:01:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know for sure, but until\NI do, my voyage will not end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.24,0:01:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what's next, I'm\Nwalking straight ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.00,0:01:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's go, there's nothing\Nthat can stop us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.66,0:01:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Though times are on our side,\Nwe'll never let it pull us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.56,0:01:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And we may fall, but we'll\Nalways keep on standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.66,0:01:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way anything will take\Nwhat I hold dear away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.78,0:01:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The voices inside me push\Nme to keep surviving.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.74,0:01:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go on. I'll get through.\NNo matter what I gotta do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.34,0:01:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The fiercest of all can pour upon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.26,0:01:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care why in the\Nworld would I turn back?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.22,0:01:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's go, there's nothing\Nthat can stop us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.96,0:02:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Though time's not on our side,\Nwe'll never let it pull us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.48,0:02:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And we may fall, but we'll\Nalways keep on standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.96,0:02:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way everything will\Ntake what I hold dear away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.18,0:02:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the future's there for us to see?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.26,0:02:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We're good!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.46,0:02:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ace is still alive, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.24,0:02:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, pull it together, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.24,0:02:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That power, it came\Nfrom Ace's brother, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.34,0:02:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.32,0:02:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost passed out back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.72,0:02:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the conqueror spirit\Nlike Pops and Shanks use.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.30,0:02:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn that kid is full of surprises, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.90,0:02:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think he realizes\Nwhat he just did.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.38,0:03:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I tell you boys we got some\Nscary stuff right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.30,0:03:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't learn that\Npower he was born with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.20,0:03:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like Pops.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.74,0:03:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If your will is weak, stand back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.06,0:03:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not just another rookie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.48,0:03:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Conqueror's spirit, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.84,0:03:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't forget he's the son of dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.26,0:03:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what we get for\Nunderestimating him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.72,0:03:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What next, Vice Admiral?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.62,0:03:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,My energy hormones didn't do that What\Nhat did you pull those powers out of?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.80,0:03:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Power?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.71,0:03:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.63,0:03:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll discuss it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.86,0:03:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not aware of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.16,0:03:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That means we can't count\Non him using it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.46,0:03:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, it's no wonder the\Npeople are so drawn to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.54,0:03:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The apple doesn't fall far\Nfrom the tree, does it, dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.98,0:03:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not let that boy\Nescape this battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.08,0:03:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If he does, he'll turn\Ninto a dire threat to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.88,0:03:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Dead or alive, you take him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.10,0:04:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Focus on Whitebeard first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.36,0:04:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He may be a monster, but he's injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.88,0:04:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Take him down, then go for the kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.34,0:04:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,After Straw Hat, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.98,0:04:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop and listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.46,0:04:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.68,0:04:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a new plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.52,0:04:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm either gonna live or I'm gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.64,0:04:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So back up Straw Hat with\Neverything you've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.36,0:04:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ace's brother, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.48,0:04:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,They're coming straight at you! Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.70,0:04:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.24,0:05:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Dory, the Bohemian Knight, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.00,0:05:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral Momonga,\Npleasure to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.36,0:05:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,To the Calvert brothers,\Nit sucks to be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.74,0:05:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta fight us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.20,0:05:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Thunderlord Mock!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.26,0:05:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon me, Vice Admiral, but I require\Na moment of your time if you would.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.46,0:05:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got some friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.48,0:05:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If Whitebeard says to lend you a\Nhand, then we're on it in a flash!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.94,0:05:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Chase is right there, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.62,0:05:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No way they're gonna stop all of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.84,0:05:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard's allies are\Nbacking up Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.08,0:05:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,This does not look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.90,0:05:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.60,0:05:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.78,0:05:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep running.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.69,0:05:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The Navy forces are\Nfocused on Pops right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.24,0:05:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So this might be your only chance to\Nslip past the admirals and move in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.42,0:05:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We're slamming them all at\Nonce, so wait for your opening.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.32,0:06:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.02,0:06:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I think they like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.24,0:06:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The greatest pirate in the\Nworld gave his seal of approval.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.18,0:06:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ace may be your brother,\Nbut he's Whitebeard's son,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.88,0:06:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,you know, and he trusts you with his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.06,0:06:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So why don't you stop trying to\Nbe coy and rise to the occasion,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.74,0:06:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,you cocky little snot?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.16,0:06:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care what that old man wants,\Nand I don't care what he thinks either.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.30,0:06:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I only came here to do one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.20,0:06:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need anyone's approval for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.20,0:06:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The pirates are gaining headway on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.40,0:06:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They're about to break through.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.78,0:06:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We need backup in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.66,0:06:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,With all due respect, maybe\Nwe should change plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.28,0:06:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.19,0:06:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,If we have a chance to defeat\NWhitebeard, then we must take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.32,0:06:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone move in now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.74,0:06:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If he falls, then it's only a\Nmatter of time for the rest of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.42,0:06:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,One or 100 doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.30,0:06:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You can stand in line or\Nyou can all die at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.78,0:07:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.92,0:07:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What's it going to take?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.04,0:07:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We think alike, brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.66,0:07:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as Ace goes home,\Nnothing else matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.92,0:07:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me the will of D.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.28,0:07:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.14,0:07:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if my days are\Nnumbered, I can see tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.70,0:07:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Blazing through this battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.56,0:07:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Hawkeye.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.56,0:07:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This could get nasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.14,0:07:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.08,0:07:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.20,0:07:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the president's order.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.22,0:07:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, we're still allies. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.50,0:07:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. One, I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.60,0:07:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.10,0:08:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Crocodile Two?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.66,0:08:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop sleeping on the job, Mr. One.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.04,0:08:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought it was like old times,\Nbut maybe prison made me soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.82,0:08:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You are needed here, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.94,0:08:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Get moving before I change my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.14,0:08:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This won't end well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.04,0:08:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you certain?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.60,0:08:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not in the mood to put up\Nwith your crap or anyone else's.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.30,0:08:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to fight,\Nthen shut up and do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.18,0:08:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, I'm here. I'll do\Neverything in my power to aid you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.22,0:08:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Target is Monkey D Luffy open fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.42,0:09:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Boa Hancock incite aborting the attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.44,0:09:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.22,0:09:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you out of your damn mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.36,0:09:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't the first time you've gotten\Nin the way, but it will be the last.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.08,0:09:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to\Naccomplish here anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.48,0:09:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to lose your warlord status.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.94,0:09:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You foolish, misshapen man-child.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.84,0:09:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Your ignorance is an affront to my beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.36,0:09:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,My what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.66,0:09:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall set a pearl of wisdom before you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.80,0:09:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Love is always a\Nhurricane, you little pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.56,0:09:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Big. You're insane, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.22,0:09:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hishman Karate!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.14,0:09:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Arabesque Brick Fist!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.20,0:10:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinbe, I can handle this, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.28,0:10:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I said to leave me and help Straw\NHat get to the scaffold, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.56,0:10:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, friend, but I'm\Nnot one of your pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.18,0:10:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That means I don't have to\Nlisten to a word you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.42,0:10:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Have it your way, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.48,0:10:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone else has already done their part.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.76,0:10:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you do yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.44,0:10:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep on running and don't look back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.20,0:10:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,For better or worse, it's our turn now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.08,0:10:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I'm sorry to make you do this\Nwhen I know you're still recovering,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.56,0:10:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,but we need your skills in particular
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.96,0:10:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No apologies necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.40,0:10:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I assure you I shall give it my best
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.26,0:11:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,They made a bridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.88,0:11:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Sinasuma of the Revolutionary Army!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.92,0:11:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that handy or what? Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.90,0:11:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hutt's headed\Nstraight for the scaffold!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.32,0:11:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.23,0:11:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, too busy to do it myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.28,0:11:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.38,0:11:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Block his path! We can't, sir! See?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.04,0:11:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,These pirates are blocking us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.36,0:11:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't get past! Fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.32,0:11:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Use your guns!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.76,0:11:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Cannoneers, open fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.30,0:11:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn! It's them!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.64,0:12:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The Whitebeard Pirates team of commanders.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.52,0:12:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Pop said to watch your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.58,0:12:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So keep running, we got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.28,0:12:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone push, we're breaking through!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.70,0:12:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Here he comes, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.38,0:12:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.48,0:12:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Battleaxe!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.96,0:12:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it straight to the\Ntop. You got it! Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.60,0:12:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He's getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.12,0:12:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Death wing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.92,0:13:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If you really want to\Nrumble, then step right up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.60,0:13:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hee-haw!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.10,0:13:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you just keep on\Nshining, Strawboy. It worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.32,0:13:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.38,0:13:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.29,0:13:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We really got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.76,0:13:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not over!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.84,0:13:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.84,0:13:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Strawhat! Savings!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.34,0:13:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's all you! Here on out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.74,0:13:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to admit, I didn't think\NWhitebeard would gamble it all on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.60,0:13:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a fun ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.36,0:13:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't kid yourself, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.20,0:13:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, don't that beat all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.90,0:13:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be a good show.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.82,0:13:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you just sit back and watch?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.84,0:13:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Reef?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.24,0:14:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.92,0:14:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.82,0:14:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Garp gonna fight too?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.28,0:14:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.00,0:14:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.52,0:14:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not moving a damned edge\NI'm a vice-admiral of the Navy
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.92,0:14:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been fighting\Npirates since long before
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.46,0:14:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,you were born and I ain't stopping today
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.38,0:14:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not my grandson.\NHere you are the pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.82,0:14:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy and I'll\Nfight you to the death.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.28,0:14:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the path that you chose to take!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.02,0:14:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You and your brother alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.96,0:15:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The bridge is going to\Ngive out, straw boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.68,0:15:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You got to move it or lose\Nit, whatever it takes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.28,0:15:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.14,0:15:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.88,0:15:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to pass me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.74,0:15:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Then treat me like any other marine\Nyou've faced and fight for your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.38,0:15:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa, this kind of hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.30,0:15:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you want me to fight\Nthese dumb monkeys all day?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.82,0:15:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your training.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.96,0:15:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Training sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.54,0:16:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,For one, I have to get hit all\Nthe time and for two, I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.14,0:16:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.52,0:16:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna be a fine marine someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.10,0:16:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.22,0:16:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm gonna be a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.32,0:16:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Marines are all lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.96,0:16:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.87,0:16:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You little punk
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.38,0:16:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The monkeys hit hard, but\Nyou're even worse, Gramps
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.00,0:16:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not hurting you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.16,0:16:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Just move!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.90,0:16:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't strike me dead,\Nthen you'll lose Ace Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.34,0:16:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't just cry till you get\Nyour way I won't show you mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.14,0:16:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a pirate, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.32,0:16:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That makes you my enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.86,0:17:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.08,0:17:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.82,0:17:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Garp!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.90,0:18:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, this is all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.94,0:18:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell am I supposed to feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.62,0:18:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Pops, Luffy, my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.12,0:18:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They're going to save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.22,0:18:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,but they're pushing through a\Nsea of their own blood to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.06,0:18:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.48,0:18:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,These are tears of joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.32,0:18:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Even after all I've done, I want to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.16,0:18:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He took down Garp?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.58,0:18:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They're family after all. Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.50,0:18:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that I believe\Nhe just might make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.10,0:18:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Change your mind I thought\Nyou said he couldn't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.04,0:19:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't say he could save\NAce now that he's at the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.92,0:19:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll die together. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.16,0:19:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.10,0:19:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You let your guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.64,0:19:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.38,0:19:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.04,0:19:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.58,0:19:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the key to your brother's handcuffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.46,0:19:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I got the key right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.90,0:19:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's great, but how?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.18,0:20:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.56,0:20:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Sengoku's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.48,0:20:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.72,0:20:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, he's huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.26,0:20:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Figure all your life, but you're\Ntrapped in the palm of my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.74,0:20:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This is insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.66,0:20:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A gold statue?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.86,0:20:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not something you\Nshould have, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.68,0:20:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fix that, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.12,0:20:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No! The key! Take aim!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.38,0:21:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait until I give the\Norder, but prepare to fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.50,0:21:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.74,0:21:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I lost it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.72,0:21:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You've dug your own grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.90,0:21:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a criminal as well, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.48,0:21:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.52,0:21:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I will execute the both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.30,0:21:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Right here, it was my own fair hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.02,0:21:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,My goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.54,0:21:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I must have passed\Nout for a moment there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.56,0:21:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Strawhead, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.50,0:21:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, three?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.41,0:21:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.40,0:21:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.10,0:21:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Three, quick, protect Ace with the wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.14,0:21:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not losing now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.78,0:21:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a giant balloon!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.46,0:22:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Candy War!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.14,0:22:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What's she doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.22,0:22:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole scaffold's coming down. What\Nhappened up there? Ain't you still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.16,0:22:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This is awful. I'll make a key
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.08,0:22:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,get those cuffs off him and hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.78,0:22:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it look captain buggy\Nthat's where brother three
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.36,0:22:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,wins holy crap I thought he\NHightailed it out of the stump,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.04,0:22:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,but now he's right in the middle of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.04,0:22:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, what the hell is he wearing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.24,0:22:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the replacement?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.74,0:22:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What could possibly be taking him so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.10,0:22:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it was short notice that\Nwe don't do this very often.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.20,0:23:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.20,0:23:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, let's move.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.08,0:23:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Frankly I couldn't care\Nless about your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.94,0:23:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.04,0:23:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of respect for my late comrade.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.42,0:23:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Laugh at me if you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.26,0:23:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But here's your key.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.36,0:23:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I laugh at that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.10,0:23:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.01,0:23:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Blow the tippets before\Nthey hit the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.04,0:23:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.95,0:23:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.87,0:23:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks three.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.48,0:23:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't look good. Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.06,0:23:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.96,0:23:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother 3!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.88,0:23:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That is an ugly way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.14,0:24:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Those handcuffs are sea prism stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.82,0:24:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Firefist's power won't\Nbe able to save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.98,0:24:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty sure we got\NStraw Hat in there, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.18,0:24:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.52,0:24:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like a tunnel of flames!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.08,0:24:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since you were little, you've never\Nlistened to a word I said, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.54,0:24:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you run off and do something crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.44,0:24:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Like old times, huh, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.26,0:24:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,They're alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.72,0:24:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.02,0:24:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a true miracle!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.68,0:24:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I see them!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.00,0:24:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Look there in the flames!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.28,0:25:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
